        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    option_type = \"call\"\n    strike_price = 0.03\n    premium = 0.015\n    yield_at_expiry = 0.035\n    multiplier = 100\n\n    # Calculate the option's intrinsic value and net profit/loss\n    intrinsic_value = max(\n        0,\n        (yield_at_expiry - strike_price) * multiplier\n    )\n    profit_loss = intrinsic_value - (premium * multiplier)\n\n    # Return the result rounded to the nearest integer\n    return round(profit_loss)\n```",
